tests/ui/types/err_show_in_arithmetic.sky:4:8: error: a value shown in km/h can only be printed
  |
4 | print((v as km/h) + 1)
  |        ^^^^^^^^^ this is for display, not a number to compute with
  = help: values are computed in SI and converted only when shown: put `as` last, `print(… as km/h)`; to get a plain number of km/h, divide by one: `x / (1 km/h)`

